hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"937","Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj told us, Abu Khaled told us, meaning Suleiman bin Hibban, h. Ali bin Khashram told us, Issa bin Yunus told us All of them, on the authority of Saad bin Ishaq bin Ka’b bin Ujrah, on the authority of Asim bin Omar bin Qatada, on the authority of Mahmoud bin Labid, who said: The Prophet went out and prayed May God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “O people, beware of the polytheism of secrets.” They said: O Messenger of God, and what is the polytheism of secrets? He said: “A man gets up and prays, and he beautifies his prayer by striving for what is seen by people looking at him, for that is shirk of secrets.”"
